{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/08.-komponen-kompleks-(navbar,-card,-dan-media-object)","title":"08. Komponen Kompleks (Navbar, Card, dan Media Object)","slug":"08. komponen kompleks (navbar, card, dan media object)","relativePath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bulma/08. Komponen Kompleks (Navbar, Card, dan Media Object).md","folder":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bulma","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":["programming"],"aliases":[],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"1. Navigasi Responsif (`.navbar`)","id":"1-navigasi-responsif-navbar"},{"depth":3,"text":"Struktur HTML Navbar Standar","id":"struktur-html-navbar-standar"},{"depth":3,"text":"Logika JavaScript Pengendali Burger Menu","id":"logika-javascript-pengendali-burger-menu"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Kartu Konten Multi-Elemen (`.card`)","id":"2-kartu-konten-multi-elemen-card"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Pola Objek Media Sosial (`.media`)","id":"3-pola-objek-media-sosial-media"}],"content":"#programming \n\nKomponen kompleks dalam Bulma dirancang untuk menangani pola desain web tingkat lanjut seperti navigasi responsif, kartu profil konten, dan tata letak media bergaya media sosial.\n\n![Pratinjau Landing Page Bulma](image/praktek_bulma_landing.png)\n\n## 1. Navigasi Responsif (`.navbar`)\n\nNavbar Bulma terdiri dari dua bagian utama:\n1. `.navbar-brand`: Selalu terlihat di semua ukuran layar (berisi logo dan tombol burger seluler).\n2. `.navbar-menu`: Berisi menu tautan navigasi. Di layar desktop otomatis terbuka horizontal, sedangkan di layar ponsel tersembunyi hingga tombol burger diaktifkan.\n\n### Struktur HTML Navbar Standar\n\n```html\n<nav class=\"navbar is-light\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"main navigation\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"navbar-brand\">\n      <!-- Logo Perusahaan -->\n      <a class=\"navbar-item\" href=\"#\">\n        <strong class=\"has-text-primary is-size-4\">BulmaApp</strong>\n      </a>\n\n      <!-- Tombol Hamburger Menu Ponsel -->\n      <a role=\"button\" class=\"navbar-burger\" aria-label=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-target=\"navbarMain\">\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Menu Tautan -->\n    <div id=\"navbarMain\" class=\"navbar-menu\">\n      <div class=\"navbar-start\">\n        <a class=\"navbar-item is-active\">Beranda</a>\n        <a class=\"navbar-item\">Dokumentasi</a>\n        <div class=\"navbar-item has-dropdown is-hoverable\">\n          <a class=\"navbar-link\">Produk</a>\n          <div class=\"navbar-dropdown\">\n            <a class=\"navbar-item\">Desain UI</a>\n            <a class=\"navbar-item\">Integrasi API</a>\n            <hr class=\"navbar-divider\">\n            <a class=\"navbar-item\">Dukungan Teknis</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"navbar-end\">\n        <div class=\"navbar-item\">\n          <div class=\"buttons\">\n            <a class=\"button is-primary\"><strong>Daftar Akun</strong></a>\n            <a class=\"button is-light\">Masuk</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n```\n\n### Logika JavaScript Pengendali Burger Menu\nKarena Bulma adalah framework 100% murni CSS, Anda perlu menambahkan skrip JavaScript sederhana untuk mengaktifkan class `.is-active` saat tombol burger ditekan:\n\n```javascript\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n  // Ambil semua elemen dengan class navbar-burger\n  const navbarBurgers = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.navbar-burger'), 0);\n\n  navbarBurgers.forEach(el => {\n    el.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      // Dapatkan target menu berdasarkan atribut data-target\n      const target = el.dataset.target;\n      const targetMenu = document.getElementById(target);\n\n      // Toggle class is-active pada tombol dan menu\n      el.classList.toggle('is-active');\n      targetMenu.classList.toggle('is-active');\n    });\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## 2. Kartu Konten Multi-Elemen (`.card`)\n\nKomponen `.card` membagi wadah informasi menjadi tiga bagian terstruktur:\n1. `.card-image`: Gambar sampul atau header visual.\n2. `.card-content`: Bagian badan teks, judul, dan deskripsi.\n3. `.card-footer`: Bagian tombol aksi bawah yang terbagi rapi menggunakan `.card-footer-item`.\n\n```html\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"card-image\">\n    <figure class=\"image is-4by3\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085\" alt=\"Koding Laptop\">\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-content\">\n    <div class=\"media\">\n      <div class=\"media-left\">\n        <figure class=\"image is-48x48\">\n          <img class=\"is-rounded\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb\" alt=\"Foto Profil\">\n        </figure>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"media-content\">\n        <p class=\"title is-5 mb-0\">Aryanda Pratama</p>\n        <p class=\"subtitle is-6\">@aryandadev</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content mt-3\">\n      Mempelajari struktur arsitektur CSS framework Bulma untuk membangun sistem desain yang konsisten dan skalabel.\n      <br>\n      <time datetime=\"2026-11-03\" class=\"has-text-grey is-size-7\">3 November 2026</time>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"card-footer\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"card-footer-item has-text-primary\">Bagikan</a>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"card-footer-item has-text-info\">Sunting</a>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"card-footer-item has-text-danger\">Hapus</a>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 3. Pola Objek Media Sosial (`.media`)\n\nClass `.media` adalah implementasi klasik pola OOCSS (Object-Oriented CSS) untuk menampilkan deretan komentar, ulasan produk, tweet, atau daftar pesan obrolan.\n\nStruktur komponen:\n- `.media-left`: Menampung gambar thumbnail avatar.\n- `.media-content`: Menampung teks utama, nama pengirim, dan isi komentar.\n- `.media-right`: Menampung tombol aksi tambahan (seperti tombol hapus atau suka).\n\n```html\n<article class=\"media\">\n  <figure class=\"media-left\">\n    <p class=\"image is-64x64\">\n      <img class=\"is-rounded\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535713875002-d1d0cf377fde\" alt=\"Avatar\">\n    </p>\n  </figure>\n  <div class=\"media-content\">\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <p>\n        <strong>Rizky Ramadhan</strong> <small>@rizkyr</small> <small>31m</small>\n        <br>\n        Bulma membuat penataan layout flexbox menjadi jauh lebih sederhana tanpa harus menulis ratusan baris CSS kustom.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"level is-mobile\">\n      <div class=\"level-left\">\n        <a class=\"level-item\"><span class=\"icon is-small\"><i class=\"fas fa-reply\"></i></span></a>\n        <a class=\"level-item\"><span class=\"icon is-small\"><i class=\"fas fa-retweet\"></i></span></a>\n        <a class=\"level-item\"><span class=\"icon is-small\"><i class=\"fas fa-heart\"></i></span></a>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"media-right\">\n    <button class=\"delete\"></button>\n  </div>\n</article>\n```\n\n---\nLanjutkan pembelajaran ke komponen interaktif: [09. Komponen Interaktif CSS-Only (Modal, Dropdown, dan Tabs)](09.%20Komponen%20Interaktif%20CSS-Only%20(Modal,%20Dropdown,%20dan%20Tabs).md).\n","excerpt":"#programming","readingTime":3,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:f3c88bf8856570761222751a3c591a0bb02d2ec3d69f0d3e3d429ce02c4076e5","outputPath":"Pemrograman/CSS/Bulma/08. Komponen Kompleks (Navbar, Card, dan Media Object)","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","CSS","Bulma"],"links":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/09.-komponen-interaktif-css-only-(modal,-dropdown,-dan-tabs)","title":"09. Komponen Interaktif CSS-Only (Modal, Dropdown, dan Tabs)","href":"/docs/pemrograman/css/bulma/09.-komponen-interaktif-css-only-(modal,-dropdown,-dan-tabs)"}],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/04_bulma-css","title":"04_Bulma CSS"},{"id":"pemrograman/css/bulma/07.-tata-letak-panggung-(hero,-section,-dan-container)","title":"07. Tata Letak Panggung (Hero, Section, dan Container)"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>Komponen kompleks dalam Bulma dirancang untuk menangani pola desain web tingkat lanjut seperti navigasi responsif, kartu profil konten, dan tata letak media bergaya media sosial.</p>\n<p><img src=\"/assets/vault/Pemrograman/CSS/Bulma/image/praktek_bulma_landing.png\" alt=\"Pratinjau Landing Page Bulma\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"1-navigasi-responsif-navbar\">1. Navigasi Responsif (<code>.navbar</code>)</h2>\n<p>Navbar Bulma terdiri dari dua bagian utama:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>.navbar-brand</code>: Selalu terlihat di semua ukuran layar (berisi logo dan tombol burger seluler).</li>\n<li><code>.navbar-menu</code>: Berisi menu tautan navigasi. Di layar desktop otomatis terbuka horizontal, sedangkan di layar ponsel tersembunyi hingga tombol burger diaktifkan.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"struktur-html-navbar-standar\">Struktur HTML Navbar Standar</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar is-light\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navigation\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-label</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"main navigation\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"container\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-brand\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Logo Perusahaan --></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"has-text-primary is-size-4\"</span>></span>BulmaApp<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Tombol Hamburger Menu Ponsel --></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"button\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-burger\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-label</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"menu\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-expanded</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"false\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-target</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbarMain\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-hidden</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"true\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-hidden</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"true\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-hidden</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"true\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-hidden</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"true\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&#x3C;!-- Menu Tautan --></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbarMain\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-menu\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-start\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item is-active\"</span>></span>Beranda<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item\"</span>></span>Dokumentasi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item has-dropdown is-hoverable\"</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-link\"</span>></span>Produk<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-dropdown\"</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item\"</span>></span>Desain UI<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item\"</span>></span>Integrasi API<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">hr</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-divider\"</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item\"</span>></span>Dukungan Teknis<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-end\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"navbar-item\"</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"buttons\"</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"button is-primary\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span>></span>Daftar Akun<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">strong</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"button is-light\"</span>></span>Masuk<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">nav</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"logika-javascript-pengendali-burger-menu\">Logika JavaScript Pengendali Burger Menu</h3>\n<p>Karena Bulma adalah framework 100% murni CSS, Anda perlu menambahkan skrip JavaScript sederhana untuk mengaktifkan class <code>.is-active</code> saat tombol burger ditekan:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-javascript\"><span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'DOMContentLoaded'</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =></span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Ambil semua elemen dengan class navbar-burger</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> navbarBurgers = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">prototype</span></span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">slice</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">call</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelectorAll</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'.navbar-burger'</span>), <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>);\n\n  navbarBurgers.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-params\">el</span> =></span> {\n    el.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'click'</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =></span> {\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Dapatkan target menu berdasarkan atribut data-target</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> target = el.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">target</span>;\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> targetMenu = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(target);\n\n      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Toggle class is-active pada tombol dan menu</span>\n      el.<span class=\"hljs-property\">classList</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toggle</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'is-active'</span>);\n      targetMenu.<span class=\"hljs-property\">classList</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toggle</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">'is-active'</span>);\n    });\n  });\n});\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"2-kartu-konten-multi-elemen-card\">2. Kartu Konten Multi-Elemen (<code>.card</code>)</h2>\n<p>Komponen <code>.card</code> membagi wadah informasi menjadi tiga bagian terstruktur:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>.card-image</code>: Gambar sampul atau header visual.</li>\n<li><code>.card-content</code>: Bagian badan teks, judul, dan deskripsi.</li>\n<li><code>.card-footer</code>: Bagian tombol aksi bawah yang terbagi rapi menggunakan <code>.card-footer-item</code>.</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"card\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"card-image\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">figure</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"image is-4by3\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Koding Laptop\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">figure</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"card-content\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"media\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"media-left\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">figure</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"image is-48x48\"</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"is-rounded\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alt</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Foto Profil\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">figure</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x