s-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"card-footer-item has-text-primary\"</span>></span>Bagikan<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"card-footer-item has-text-info\"</span>></span>Sunting<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"#\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"card-footer-item has-text-danger\"</span>></span>Hapus<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">a</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">footer</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"3-pola-objek-media-sosial-media\">3. Pola Objek Media Sosial (<code>.media</code>)</h2>\n<p>Class <code>.media</code> adalah implementasi klasik pola OOCSS (Object-Oriented CSS) untuk menampilkan deretan komentar, ulasan produk, tweet, atau daftar pesan obrolan.</p>\n<p>Struktur komponen:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>.media-left</code>: Menampung gambar thumbnail avatar.</li>\n<li><code>.media-content</code>: Menampung teks utama, nama pengirim, dan isi komentar.</li>\n<li><code>.media-right</code>: Menampung tombol aksi tambahan (seperti tombol hapus atau suka).</li>\n</ul>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">article</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"media\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">figure</span> <s